␛[0;33m**Month-end routine**␛[m
␛[0;33mStatements land in the shared folder by the **third** of the␛[m
␛[0;33mmonth.␛[m

␛[0;33m- Export the bank CSVs first␛[m
␛[0;33m- Then reconcile the card, oldest charge first␛[m
␛[0;33m- Leave the line of credit for the end␛[m

␛[0;33mIf a statement is late, say so on the card and move on. Do␛[m
␛[0;33mnot chase it before the fifth.␛[m
